data: {"id": "3b9df4aa68754176-final", "run_id": "3b9df4aa68754176", "seq": 1046, "ts_ms": 1788446699745, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `fact-ccd39fb548d8` | `container: app`, `last_terminated_reason: Error` | 确认应用容器异常终止 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-336855e6ff5f` | `container: app`, `last_exit_code: 78` | 确定异常终止的具体退出码 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | `fact-0074c73b6457` | `Warning BackOff 1s (x202 over 44m)` | 证明容器已持续进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n| 4 | Logging | `fact-38a061289929` (聚合) | `CONFIG_MISSING` (8次, 500错误), `allocated_mib` 维持 0 | 直接揭示应用内部因配置缺失导致的逻辑失败及资源占用情况 |\n| 5 | Tracing | `fact-e7ccfbc9ffc1` | `GET /work` `status_code: 500` (trace: `9458884b...`) | 关联日志中的特定 trace_id，确认 500 响应与配置缺失现象一致 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | `fact-122fd5dd43ea` | `container: app`, `restart_count: 13` | 量化故障持续时间与重启频率 |\n\n**证据链说明：**\n应用容器启动后尝试处理 HTTP 请求，由于缺失配置（`CONFIG_MISSING`）返回 500 状态码并触发内部逻辑退出，最终导致容器以退出码 `78` 终止（证据 1, 2, 4）。Kubernetes 检测到该退出码并不断重启容器，累计 13 次（证据 5, 6），最终 Pod 状态因频繁重启且间隔过短而进入 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 3）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用依赖的配置项缺失 → 初始化/启动逻辑检测到 CONFIG_MISSING 并返回 500 错误 → 进程主动以 Exit Code 78 终止 → 容器被 kubelet 重启，进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：应用代码在启动阶段因关键配置缺失（`CONFIG_MISSING`）未能正确初始化，导致请求处理失败并主动异常退出（退出码 78）。\n\n依据：日志中重复出现 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式（fact-38a061289929），Tracing 确认关联请求返回 500（fact-e7ccfbc9ffc1），且退出码 78（fact-336855e6ff5f）证实了终止是由应用进程主导而非系统资源限制（如 OOMKilled 通常为 137）。\n\n缺失事实：日志未明确指明缺失的具体配置项名称（如具体的 ConfigMap Key 或 EnvVar 变量名），该细节需通过检查 Pod 规范或应用源码确认。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 65.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 65.9s (Evidence 56.6s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 100.446, "metrics": {"run_id": "3b9df4aa68754176", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 100.45251226425171, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 100452.51226425171, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 69394.28114891052, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 8, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 39588.02938461304, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 30577.048301696777}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23731.44817352295, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 65889.69945907593, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10810.399293899536, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

